	(text "U3C spare - parked as unity follower, +in to GND (do not leave open-loop)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.352 56.134 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "35c50750-009d-4759-975a-cbf790987a57")
	)
	(text "U6B spare - both inputs tied to GND; open-collector output left floating"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.052 140.208 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "547cb40c-5cfa-400b-acdf-18fe4fc6d27b")
	)
	(text "470k series is the CV input protection - the MCP6004 internal input\nclamps absorb the overvoltage. Intentional; no external clamp diodes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 57.912 160.528 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "56d3b7dc-b50c-407e-924e-17e070eba10f")
	)
	(text "V/OCT PITCH STAGE (U3D, MCP6004)\nShares the CLK jack - taps CLK_RAW in parallel; clock path untouched.\nSelected by MODE_SW (panel toggle); the two modes are mutually exclusive.\nDivider R_voct1 (10k) / R_voct2 (18k) = 0.643x -> 0-5V in maps to 0-3.21V\n  (~5 octaves; firmware calibrates 1V/oct, 0V = C1)\nD_oct1 / D_oct2 (BAT54WS) clamp the divider node to +3V3 / GND\nU3D unity buffer -> R_voct_adc1 (1k) + C_voct_adc1 (1nF) -> ADC_6 (pin 28)\nJack loading: divider presents ~28k to the source (see daisy-avw)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.352 161.036 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "83a034ae-e635-4612-b902-6e09ac383b26")
	)
	(text "C_byp_U3 (+3V3), C_byp_U5 / C_byp_U6 (+5V),\nC_byp_U4n1 / C_byp_U4p1 (+/-12V): local 100nF decoupling"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44.958 240.538 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "949103af-fdb7-40bb-983b-8604ac3f6591")
	)
	(text "U4B spare - parked as unity follower, +in to GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 159.512 252.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "951e745a-4e99-477e-91ca-abc6314fa7af")
	)
	(text "Op-amp supplies: U3 MCP6004 = single +3V3 rail-to-rail.\nU4 TL072 = +/-12V.  U5 / U6 = +5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44.958 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aaca1626-5332-460c-9b08-72168010d118")
	)
	(text "CV INPUT CONDITIONING (U3A / U3B, MCP6004, single +3V3 rail-to-rail)\nInverting summer per channel:\n  POT via R2/R5 (100k)        -> gain -1\n  CV  via R3/R6 (470k)        -> gain -0.213  (+/-5V CV = +/-2.13V swing)\n  VREF_NEG5V via R4/R7 (200k) -> +2.5V mid-rail offset\n  R_fb 100k feedback; C_fb 1nF -> 1.59kHz LPF\nPOT SIGNAL IS INVERTED - firmware compensates"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.688 48.514 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4000000-aa00-0000-0000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "CLOCK INPUT (U6A, LM393) - comparator with hysteresis\nLM393 runs on +5V but the output is OPEN-COLLECTOR, pulled to\n+3V3 by R_clk_pu1 (10k) -> safe 3.3V swing into D6. NOT a 5V drive.\nThresholds ~1.57V / ~1.72V (R_div1/R_div2 10k set 1.65V; R_hys1 100k\ngives ~150mV hysteresis). R_clk_in1 (10k) series; D4/D5 BAT54WS clamps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 290.322 66.802 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4000000-aa00-0000-0000-000000000002")
	)
	(text "GATE INPUT (Q1, MMBT3904) - inverting level shifter\nR_gate_in1 (100k) to base, R_gate_div1 (33k) + D3 (1N4148) to GND\nNO collector pull-up on the PCB - relies on the MCU internal pull-up.\nSignal is INVERTED at the pin; firmware EXTI triggers on pin-falling."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.178 183.134 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4000000-aa00-0000-0000-000000000003")
	)
	(text "GATE OUTPUT (U5, 74AHCT1G125) - 3.3V to 5V level shifter\nAHCT (not AHC) chosen for TTL input thresholds - 3.3V drives it cleanly\nR_gout1 (1k) series -> D6/D7 (1N5819WS) clamps -> jack (~5V gate)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 283.464 173.228 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4000000-aa00-0000-0000-000000000004")
	)
	(text "CV OUTPUT (Daisy Seed internal 12-bit DAC + U4A, TL072 on +/-12V)\nCV_OUT_DAC (0-3.3V) -> U4A non-inverting, gain = 1 + 20k/10k = 3x -> 0-9.9V\nR_cv_out1 (1k) series. No clamp diodes on this jack - 1k is the only protection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.574 183.896 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4000000-aa00-0000-0000-000000000005")
	)
